Updates the first-contact-solver note with the full-pass scorecard (10/25 = 40%), the multi-paradigm
escalation architecture (classify-then-dispatch rejected by measurement; click-interaction tier added
4 solves), and the REFINED research backlog: the 15 remaining failures split into TOGGLE/CONFIGURATION
